    "preamble": "Janagani Pawan vs Sub Inspector Of Police on 17 November, 2020 Author: K. Lakshman Bench: K. Lakshman The Honourable Sri Justice K. Lakshman Crimminal Petition No.5652 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioners are Accused Nos.1 to 3 in the said case. The offences alleged against them are under Sections 270 and 273 of IPC. 2.",
